# Danbury Bright Smiles — Dental Practice Website

A professional, fully responsive business website designed and developed for **Danbury Bright Smiles**, a US-based family and cosmetic dental practice in Danbury, CT. Delivered completely remotely as a freelance project.

## 🌐 Live Preview

> Open `index.html` in any browser — no server required.

## ✨ Features

- **Responsive design** — works on mobile, tablet, and desktop
- **Bilingual support** — English / Spanish language switcher
- **Animated hero section** — SVG smile trace animation + ambient bubble effects
- **Services section** — interactive cards with modal popups for each service
- **Appointment booking modal** — patient-friendly form
- **Contact form** — with success feedback
- **Google Maps embed** — clinic location
- **Scroll reveal animations** — smooth entrance effects
- **Sticky navbar** — with shadow on scroll
- **Patient testimonials** — review cards
- **Trust strip** — key stats (18+ years, 12,000+ patients, 4.9★ rating)

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- HTML5
- CSS3 (Custom Properties / CSS Variables)
- JavaScript (Vanilla)
- Bootstrap 5.3
- Google Fonts (Fraunces + Inter)

## 📁 Project Structure

```
danbury-bright-smiles/
└── index.html       # Complete single-file website
```

## 🚀 How to Run

```bash
# Clone the repo
git clone https://github.com/am-cybersec/Danbury-Bright-Smiles

# Open in browser
open index.html
```

