## 🔑 Key Highlights

- Built bilingual (EN/ES) switcher using vanilla JS data attributes
- Animated SVG smile illustration in hero section
- Intersection Observer API for scroll-based reveal animations
- Service detail modals with dynamic content injection
- Zero external JS dependencies beyond Bootstrap